vailability at a specific parcel."],[6,"Online-safety enforcement powers and financial penalties contain no evidence about broadband or mobile service at a parcel."],[7,"A proposed specialist radar licence and spectrum bands do not establish public telecom coverage, capacity or speed at a parcel."],[8,"Consumer scam-response guidance does not prove provider availability, network quality or parcel-level internet access."],[9,"Scam warning signs are safety guidance and cannot be converted into parcel coverage, speed or service-status values."],[10,"Fraud-protection recommendations do not provide evidence of broadband technology, mobile signal or exact service at a parcel."],[11,"Contract price rules and exit rights do not establish whether a package is available or active at an individual parcel."],[12,"Premium-rate service market research and billing mechanisms do not prove internet access, network coverage or speed at a parcel."],[13,"Messaging anti-fraud duties and blocking rules do not prove mobile signal, broadband availability or measured parcel performance."],[14,"Switching-process compliance and enforcement closure do not establish a provider's service availability or speed at a parcel."],[15,"Satellite gateway spectrum authorisation by area class does not prove consumer satellite service or performance at a particular parcel."]],"guardrails":{"aggregate_or_policy_to_parcel_promotion":false,"fake_data":false,"db_write":false,"migration":false,"production_deploy":false}}